From f37a111680aa81220db4873f202318269f8be81c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 12:29:44 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mcp): add AI batch undo, get_selection tool, and live
 confirmation gate

Add three AI chat safety mechanisms for #1942:
- Add BatchCommand and History::begin_group/commit_group/cancel_group so a
  multi-call AI chat turn folds into one Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y undo step.
- Add the read-only get_selection MCP tool reading selected entities,
  active setup/operation, viewport pick mode, and active geometry picks
  while keeping ui -> app layering.
- Add LiveGate, requires_approval, and answer_live_with at live MCP
  dispatch, forbid auto-approval of posting and machine edits, share the
  approval rule with AiChatState/transport, and bind Allow clicks to a
  single-call ApprovedCall.

Fixes #1942
